m — supporting their passion is amazing and their enthusiasm is inspiring [S29T9].\n- On 2023-11-13, said of supporting the young musicians \"it's like a torch being passed to keep music alive!\"; the young musicians are very ambitious and he thinks he will support them for a long time (Dave: \"Your support for them keeps the music going and passes on the legacy.\") [S29T11][S29T12].\n- On 2023-11-13, said he's \"stoked [he] made a difference\" — \"paying it forward\" — and that working with new talent brings new ideas to his work; shared a photo of himself making a beat for a young artist (a photo of a man sitting at a desk in front of a computer), saying the artist has great potential in music (Dave: \"Wow, that's cool! Your music studio looks great.\") [S29T13].\n- On 2023-11-17, told Dave (when asked who he had the most interesting chat with at the fancy Boston gala he attended the day before, 2023-11-16): he had a really interesting conversation with \"this cool artist\" — \"we clicked over music and art\" — and they talked about their favorite artists, art, and \"how the power of music connects us all\"; \"It was such an inspiring conversation - I feel like I'm on a creative high.\" — and shared a photo of the two of them sitting on a bench in the snow (a photo of the artist, not previously named or identified) [S30T4]. Dave: \"That's amazing, Calvin! Music really does bring people together and foster creativity. Glad to hear you had such an inspiring conversation!\" (Dave's side in the Music section of /memories/dave.md; conversation flow in the 2023-11-17 entry of ## Relationships) [S30T5].","text_sha256":"9ec2ab53e9b6e2faf92dce48fcfa5825895a48b0e4e546dd266763c7c171125b","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D28:29"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":106,"line_start":106,"source_locators":["[S28T29]"],"text_sha256":"a7788649dfb0e4570095c22dda13516f3e16